/S /H2
/P 103 0 R
/T (The Brahmaputra Basin in Assam experiences frequent and severe flooding, yet reliable flood susceptibility maps remain limited due to complex geospatial interactions. Conventional methods and classical models face challenges in scalability and feature complexity, motivating the evaluation of Quantum Machine Learning for improved flood susceptibility prediction.)
